{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And behold, your eyes see.</b> My glory, and that I am your brother — that I am circumcised as you are. And further, <b>that it is my mouth speaking to you</b> — in the holy tongue (Bereshit Rabbah)." "<b>And the eyes of my brother Benjamin.</b> He equalized them all together, to say: just as I bear no hatred toward Benjamin my brother — for he had no part in my recognition — so is there no hatred in my heart toward you."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:36.983506460Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}